        "Discovers the four latent passenger personas (Commuter, Casual, Tourist, Student) using volume-weighted K-means and Hungarian matching."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 17,
      "id": "935d3259",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
