            "18:02:41 │ INFO    │ ✔ done    [exogenous] in 0.2s → exogenous__2023__75783a8204.pkl\n",
            "z_t global : (6156, 7)  → ['tod_sin', 'tod_cos', 'dow_sin', 'dow_cos', 'is_weekend', 'event_flag', 'event_countdown']\n",
            "z_t node   : (6156, 191, 3)  → ['transfer_ratio', 'venue_proximity', 'event_station']\n",
